{"4085150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pathways & Poltergeists", "steam_appid": 4085150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four ghost friends are lost in the fog. Build pathways from 3D polyomino pieces to guide them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pathways &amp; Poltergeists, you'll place, rotate, and connect modular pathway pieces to navigate each ghost to their exit. What starts simple quickly evolves with obstacles blocking your path, waypoints requiring connections, teleporters break the space, and multiple ghosts need to move in unison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085150/extras/372930381061df4e0345ea5ae0724207.poster.avif?t=1774750955\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085150/extras/372930381061df4e0345ea5ae0724207.webm?t=1774750955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085150/extras/372930381061df4e0345ea5ae0724207.mp4?t=1774750955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle introduces something new. No filler, just  problems that will challenge how you think about space and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted puzzles  spread across 7 mechanical zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085150/extras/51d587881b15df4bf420d3cdd4ad927d.poster.avif?t=1774750955\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka